{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p002402","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p002402"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p002402","label":"樓緩（趙世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"樓緩","mention_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0058","c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0174","c-shiji-043-zhao:m072-0032"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0058","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p067","quote":"樓緩"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0174","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p067","quote":"樓緩"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m072-0032","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p072","quote":"樓緩"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002402","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p067","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0174","start":174,"end":176,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002402","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p067","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m072-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002402","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p072","chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-173","person_id":"cbr-p002402","surfaces":["樓緩"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p067","quote":"十九年春正月，大朝信宮。召肥義與議天下，五日而畢。王北略中山之地，至於房子，遂之代，北至無窮，西至河，登黃華之上。召樓緩謀曰：「我先王因世之變，以長南藩之地，屬阻漳、滏之險，立長城，又取藺、郭狼，敗林人於荏，而功未遂。今中山在我腹心，北有燕，東有胡，西有林胡、樓煩、秦、韓之邊，而無彊兵之救，是亡社稷，柰何？夫有髙世之名，必有遺俗之累。吾欲胡服。」樓緩曰：「善。」群臣皆不欲。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p072","quote":"二十年，王略中山地，至寧葭；西略胡地，至楡中。林胡王獻馬。歸，使樓緩之秦，仇液之韓，王賁之楚，富丁之魏，趙爵之齊。代相趙固主胡，致其兵。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為與連續事件；太戊午／大戊午暫接但字形待底本核查。娃嬴／孟姚／惠后按本段明示暫接，不與先前夢辭孟姚按同名合併；王紲與較早公子紲分候選。君王職稱按各國上下文辨別，不全域匹配。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p067","text":"十九年春正月，大朝信宮。召肥義與議天下，五日而畢。王北略中山之地，至於房子，遂之代，北至無窮，西至河，登黃華之上。召樓緩謀曰：「我先王因世之變，以長南藩之地，屬阻漳、滏之險，立長城，又取藺、郭狼，敗林人於荏，而功未遂。今中山在我腹心，北有燕，東有胡，西有林胡、樓煩、秦、韓之邊，而無彊兵之救，是亡社稷，柰何？夫有髙世之名，必有遺俗之累。吾欲胡服。」樓緩曰：「善。」群臣皆不欲。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"肥義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002402","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0174","start":174,"end":176,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002402","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、夢中女子或待核官稱／親稱保留；不從同名、國號與未名先王補個人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p072","text":"二十年，王略中山地，至寧葭；西略胡地，至楡中。林胡王獻馬。歸，使樓緩之秦，仇液之韓，王賁之楚，富丁之魏，趙爵之齊。代相趙固主胡，致其兵。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m072-0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zha